// An investor: a software engineer with a taxable brokerage, employer stock, an
// employee stock purchase plan and a little crypto. September 2024 to December
// 2025; the 2025 tax year is the one to read.
//
// Lots older than 2024 cannot be entered at their true dates: the shipped `us`
// system has no tax figures before 2024, and a year-end law with no figures is an
// error. So the ledger starts in September 2024, and everything held is younger.
//
// The folders are constraints: journal/2024.ax holds 2024 only,
// journal/2025/03.ax holds March 2025 only.

base USD

use std
use us
use us/401k

/// Sam, 34, single, in Seattle: no state income tax, so `lives us` is the whole
/// story. Northwind Systems is the employer.
entity me : person
  born   1991-03-22
  filing single
  lives  us
